  "details": "1. Launch VRChat.\n\n2. Create a post and an event in a group. Do not open the Quick Menu. You should see notifications appear as they're created.\n\n3. Close the VRChat client window.\n\nExpected result: At step 3, no extra notifications should appear.\n\nActual result: Queued (unread?) notifications from step 2 are displayed again when the VRChat window is closed, leading to FOMO (fear of missing out) in user behavior.\n\nAffects `Build 1867` and `Build 1903`.",
